{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rise of the Shepherd</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a biblical action-adventure RPG set in ancient Israel.</strong> Play as David in third-person combat, <strong>battle giants, explore vast deserts and villages, complete quests</strong>, and experience a cinematic journey of <strong>faith, courage, and destiny.</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943540/extras/2b33e18d3f943e1b491d65e875c9f8bf.poster.avif?t=1756493705\" aria-label=\"Rise of the Shepherd\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943540/extras/2b33e18d3f943e1b491d65e875c9f8bf.webm?t=1756493705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943540/extras/2b33e18d3f943e1b491d65e875c9f8bf.mp4?t=1756493705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Faith Forged in Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master fast, skill-based melee combat.</strong> Wield sticks, slings, and shields to <strong>chain attacks, dodge perfectly, and parry with precision.</strong> Every strike is weighty and rewarding, from <strong>soldiers to feral beasts.</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943540/extras/145694d5b517b74d5b9f22bf38bf81c2.poster.avif?t=1756493705\" aria-label=\"Faith Forged in Battle\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943540/extras/145694d5b517b74d5b9f22bf38bf81c2.webm?t=1756493705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943540/extras/145694d5b517b74d5b9f22bf38bf81c2.mp4?t=1756493705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover the Holy Lands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore seamless open-world environments.</strong> Climb cliffs, wade rivers, and uncover hidden scrolls and secrets. <strong>Earn blessings, unlock upgrades, and dive into rich lore</strong> scattered across deserts, ruins, and sacred landmarks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943540/extras/4e2e65508d0c74db546e8b78c1ca9732.poster.avif?t=1756493705\" aria-label=\"Discover the Holy Lands\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943540/extras/4e2e65508d0c74db546e8b78c1ca9732.webm?t=1756493705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943540/extras/4e2e65508d0c74db546e8b78c1ca9732.mp4?t=1756493705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face Legendary Giants</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Confront colossal bosses in cinematic showdowns.</strong> Dodge devastating strikes, exploit weaknesses, and <strong>deliver epic finishing moves</strong> inspired by scripture\u2019s most iconic battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943540/extras/0486a69ba6f9c3d434eb29a3683b98e4.poster.avif?t=1756493705\" aria-label=\"Face Legendary Giants\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943540/extras/0486a69ba6f9c3d434eb29a3683b98e4.webm?t=1756493705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943540/extras/0486a69ba6f9c3d434eb29a3683b98e4.mp4?t=1756493705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Face towering giants with unique mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skill-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Master dodges, parries, and powerful combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Exploration</strong> \u2013 Traverse deserts, valleys, and sacred ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest-Driven Adventure</strong> \u2013 Discover scrolls, missions, and lore rewards.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943540?t=1756493705","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943540/3d0ca4cdbcca229c1a0d9d647254c7531bdbcc4a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756493705","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943540/75f3e8f35f9af628729d0518c074e0fb2a3baaee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756493705","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943540/75f3e8f35f9af628729d0518c074e0fb2a3baaee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756493705","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_descript